r. The format cannot roll a table by level: prose in level_progression; BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F116. The table entries themselves are in the GM Notes. || NOT STORED: pronunciation doo-TAH-nee, also known as The Gifted or Receivers of the Gift, size (males 6-7 feet, females 5 feet to 5 feet 10 inches), weight (males 110-170 lbs, females 90-140 lbs), life span 6D6+160, reproduction, slave market value 6D6x10,000, habitat, allies and enemies are in GM Notes. Experience Level 1D8+2 for NPCs is a population figure."
